{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_45_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_45","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_45_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_45","textTraditional":"二、夏，宋人、齊人、衞人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_45_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_45","textTraditional":"三、冬十有二月，公會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、鄭伯、許男、曹伯、滑伯、滕子，同盟于幽。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_45_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_45","textTraditional":"同盟者何？同欲也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_45_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_45","textTraditional":"四、邾婁子克卒。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}